    "findings": [
      "Several layers share correlated coverage masks and collapse toward the white background; source-only screenshots reproduce the washout.",
      "A coverage source writes depth, but translucent actuators had lost the existing contact-face depth priority. Enabling only that offset removed the strong stripes while coverage and opacity stayed identical.",
